# Theo Browne

Theo distinguishes product breadth from feature depth and describes how extension points can let users build missing features. [AI Engineer World's Fair, 13:23](https://youtu.be/xUnRQ9vLXxo?t=803) [14:37](https://youtu.be/xUnRQ9vLXxo?t=877).

He argues that a model's ordinary reliability matters more than its best result when agents work on longer tasks. [Please stop using stupid models, 04:19](https://youtu.be/iBrAWpjXNxs?t=259).
